t":"2025-11-13T18:36:38Z"},"body":"This PR adds support for frame synthesis to Godot. Frame synthesis is OpenXRs core API for advanced reprojection (e.g. Space Warp). When enabled, provided its supported by the XR runtime, a lower resolution motion vector buffer and depth buffer is rendered and provided to the XR runtime. The XR runtime can now inject reprojection frames and compensate for lower framerates.\r\n\r\nCurrent limitations:\r\n- Does not work on the Forward+ renderer\r\n- Requires #97151 for Compatibility\r\n- Only works with stereo rendering\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> There is an outstanding question about Vulkan NDC however testing on PICO hardware this is working as expected.\r\n> We'll do an additional PR if there turns out to be an issue on other hardware once they support this extension.\r\n\r\n*Contributed by Khronos Group through the Godot Integration Project*","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109803/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"